WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.991
Bloch's conjecture for surfaces.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.387
On a surface without two-forms, Bloch predicted all points are rationally equivalent.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.364
A virtual count splits the diagonal; its

4
00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:13.562
coefficient is positive in both cases.

5
